MeeTranslate - translator for the Nokia N9
Designed and written by Claude (Anthropic) together with smyhu.

Copyright (c) 2026 smyhu
License: MIT (see LICENSE in the source repository)

Data and services used at run time:
- Google Translate and Google text-to-speech (translate.googleapis.com,
  translate.google.com), unofficial public endpoints.
- MyMemory (api.mymemory.translated.net).
- WikDict dictionaries (download.wikdict.com), built from Wiktionary,
  CC BY-SA 3.0; downloaded by the user, not shipped in this package.
Language names: Google Translate language list.
Look inspired by TAO Translator by Oleksii Serdiuk (no code taken).
